      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَعَرٌ مُعَقَّفٌ</span></b>  [<i>Hair that is recurvate at the
extremities;</i> as though ending with hooks]:
(M and TA voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَحْجَنُ</span>:) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَعَرٌ مَعْقُوفٌ</span></b> 
[signifies the same]. (TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سدل</span>.) [See
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُعَكَّفٌ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعْكُوفٌ</span>.]

